 "made": "2026-11-17T17:14:51-05:00",
 "about": "Out-of-combat rest cues for an in-game add-on, every class and leveling spec (2026-11-16, user: \"I want the addon to not proc during combat. Also, I just want to be eat/drink/evocation for now. Also I want it to work across all different classes and specs\").",
 "rules": "Out of combat only. drink_below / eat_below: shares of maximum mana / health; tools: the class's own mana tools between fights, in order (a tool's cue comes before drinking). The fight lab drinks and eats back to full once a cue fires. eat_drink_together (per spec; absent = false): while you sit to drink or to eat, the other bar tops up too, at no extra time, only while it is below full; you stand when the bar that fired is full (the topped-up one may be left short). Evocation is not sitting and brings no top-up. vectors: the fight lab's own decision on set states, for the add-on's tests (hp and mana as shares; does in order; after: the bars once the tool ran; warlocks: health_max and tap_cost).",
